      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so im feeling kinda weird lately. im drinking like crazy amount of water all day but i still feel thirsty and i feel like im constantly running to the bathroom. also my breath smells kinda sweet/fruity for some reason?? id say its like nail polish remover lol. do u think im just dehydrated or something?",
