    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait diabetes?? that sounds scary lol. i havent really had any other issues like being tired or anything, just the thirst thing. do u think it could just be something i ate or maybe i'm just getting a little flu or something? i really dont want to go to the doctor if i don't have to, it's a hassle. can i just try drinking some coconut water or electrolytes for a few days and see if that fixes it?",
